--- Compound Assignment on Attributes, Elements and Keys ---
--- Every operator on an attribute ---
PASS: attribute +=
PASS: attribute -=
PASS: attribute *=
PASS: attribute /=
PASS: attribute %=
PASS: attribute //=
PASS: attribute **=
PASS: attribute &=
PASS: attribute |=
PASS: attribute ^=
PASS: attribute <<=
PASS: attribute >>=
--- Every operator on a list element ---
PASS: element +=
PASS: element -=
PASS: element *=
PASS: element /=
PASS: element %=
PASS: element //=
PASS: element **=
PASS: element &=
PASS: element |=
PASS: element ^=
PASS: element <<=
PASS: element >>=
--- Other targets ---
PASS: string element +=
PASS: dict key +=
PASS: nested element *=
PASS: grid cell +=
PASS: negative index +=
--- Compound assignment inside methods ---
PASS: private attribute += through a method
PASS: and again
--- Errors ---
PASS: index out of range -> List index 99 out of bounds
PASS: negative index out of range -> List index -99 out of bounds
PASS: missing attribute -> Instance of 'Counter' has no attribute 'nothing'
PASS: private attribute from outside -> Cannot access private member 'hidden'
PASS: illegal operand on element -> Illegal operation
PASS: illegal operand on attribute -> Illegal operation
PASS: division by zero on element -> Division by zero
PASS: division by zero on attribute -> Division by zero
PASS: modulo by zero on element -> Division by zero
PASS: NULL index -> List index must be a Number
PASS: string element is immutable -> Illegal operation
PASS: missing dict key -> Key 'none' not found
PASS: compound on a number -> Illegal operation
PASS: compound attribute on a number -> Illegal operation
